                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "3d721e69-1840-4cb4-84dd-a39024f01d4e",
                        "entry_id": "af630943-812f-319d-9cc9-b2b312f58745",
                        "tags": [
                            "orthographe rectifiée de 1990"
                        ],
                        "form": "pouding"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "9147a44b-1c87-3af1-8bcc-f01806d6bbac",
                        "entry_id": "af630943-812f-319d-9cc9-b2b312f58745",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Entremets de la cuisine anglaise, aujourd’hui sucré (à l’origine salé, avec du beurre et même de la viande), souvent avec du lait, et en particulier celui composé de mie de pain, de moelle de bœuf, de raisins de Corinthe et autres ingrédients (correspondant au bread pudding en anglais)."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "5a70a619-c86c-46de-b43d-106b2d2312ce",
                                "sense_id": "9147a44b-1c87-3af1-8bcc-f01806d6bbac",
                                "text": "Sur la table s’élevait un pudding pyramidal que Mrs. Joliffe avait confectionné de sa main; c’était un énorme cône tronqué, composé de farine, de graisse de rennes et de bœuf musqué, auquel manquaient peut-être les œufs, le lait, le citron recommandés par les traités de cuisine, mais qui rachetait ce défaut par ses proportions gigantesques."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0828200b-45cb-4dfe-b0b1-ade468a7cc3d",
                                "sense_id": "9147a44b-1c87-3af1-8bcc-f01806d6bbac",
                                "text": "Devant une bonne choucroûte au jambon, ils oublièrent le pudding de graisse de phoque farci aux myrtilles !"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3cd5a2af-3353-4295-b29b-4fbbd7906d01",
                                "sense_id": "9147a44b-1c87-3af1-8bcc-f01806d6bbac",
                                "text": "C’est très difficile à séduire, une gourde. Je regrette un peu d’avoir essayé. On croit qu’il suffit de quelques insolences bien choisies pour leur verser du feu dans les veines et les faire flamber comme des puddings de Noël, mais celle-ci est d’une espèce particulière."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ec9505c2-be1a-4bc4-9883-c375f6a992bf",
                                "sense_id": "9147a44b-1c87-3af1-8bcc-f01806d6bbac",
                                "text": "« Bénie soit la cuisine anglaise, et son célèbre pudding.\n— Alimentaire, mon cher Holmes. »"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "53c93706-7eb5-4ed4-ae5a-76d9b8b68d9f",
                        "source_entry_id": "af630943-812f-319d-9cc9-b2b312f58745",
                        "source_sense_id": "9147a44b-1c87-3af1-8bcc-f01806d6bbac",
                        "target_lang_word": "pudding",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "pudding",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "90205eef-1493-3902-9274-5b91c3a5208f",
                                        "entry_id": "dffa51c1-61bc-3920-bc6c-767c92844c62",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Any of various dishes, sweet or savoury, prepared by boiling or steaming, or from batter."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "da3ea48f-1b48-45c2-82ac-44c2cee32b29",
                                                "sense_id": "90205eef-1493-3902-9274-5b91c3a5208f",
                                                "text": "The dishes in this chapter represent a range of multiethnic savory custards and steamed puddings, including a few surprises like a chèvre popover pudding and a bread pudding with lettuce and cheese."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "87e5c3f9-1f1a-443c-94b6-d311b910ae8e",
                                                "sense_id": "90205eef-1493-3902-9274-5b91c3a5208f",
                                                "text": "Steamed and boiled puddings have formed the basic diet of country people in northern Europe for centuries. Early puddings consisted of the scoured stomach of a sheep or pig, stuffed with its own suet and offal, which has been thickened with oatmeal, and boiled in water or baked in the ashes of a fire."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ae75be97-63dd-35bd-8a4b-c01c8ebaaff8",
                                        "entry_id": "dffa51c1-61bc-3920-bc6c-767c92844c62",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A type of cake or dessert cooked usually by boiling or steaming."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "87e4bc09-bed7-41ca-b138-6d898b049f45",
                                                "sense_id": "ae75be97-63dd-35bd-8a4b-c01c8ebaaff8",
                                                "text": "Steamed puddings, a favourite for winter, are both easy to make and delicious. Served with one of the sweet sauces (recipes 497 to 506) they make a filling and satisfying end to a meal."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "72b7597c-2089-3123-8a76-9a23822bec09",
                                        "entry_id": "dffa51c1-61bc-3920-bc6c-767c92844c62",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A type of dessert that has a texture similar to custard or mousse but using some kind of starch as the thickening agent."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d8685066-d19b-399e-9ccc-1f95291d2524",
                                        "entry_id": "dffa51c1-61bc-3920-bc6c-767c92844c62",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Dessert; the dessert course of a meal."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Australia",
                                            "New-Zealand",
                                            "UK",
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "885073f7-8c55-49bf-8a42-13053002f673",
                                                "sense_id": "d8685066-d19b-399e-9ccc-1f95291d2524",
                                                "text": "We have apple pie for pudding today."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e994c9cd-93b4-3746-8bc0-2d6b4c375fb8",
                                        "entry_id": "dffa51c1-61bc-3920-bc6c-767c92844c62",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A sausage made primarily from blood."
                                        ],
